# Copy this file to .env.local. All keys below are OPTIONAL server-side
# fallbacks - the app lets whoever submits an idea pick a provider and paste
# their own key in the UI at request time. A key here is only used when the
# UI's key field is left blank for that provider; the run record always
# says which source ("user_provided" vs "server_env") was actually used.
# .env.local is gitignored - never commit real credentials.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...

# Optional tuning (defaults shown):
# LLM_MAX_TOKENS=8000
# ANTHROPIC_EFFORT=high
# MAX_RUN_STEPS=81
